      "widgets_values": ["# TRELLIS.2 MLX — SPARSE STRUCTURE ONLY\n\nThis workflow consumes one explicitly promoted CFP conditioning artifact.\n\n- Paste the `artifact_path` produced by the Image Conditioning workflow.\n- The loader validates schema and content hash.\n- TRELLIS samples and decodes only the 32³ sparse occupancy coordinates.\n- Shape, texture, mesh extraction, topology sanitation, and GLB export do not run.\n- No 3D preview exists at this stage because the artifact is occupancy coordinates, not a mesh.\n- Automatic promotion is disabled."],
